# Fix Direct Print Orientation — Use PDF Path for Silent Printing

**Problem:** "Direct" (no-preview) print mode for dispatch challans and dispatch slips produces rotated/upside-down output because it generates PNG images and prints them via [silent_print_image()](file:///c:/Users/Kevin%20Biju%20Kulangara/OneDrive/Desktop/laundry/utils/receipt.py#562-693) (raw Win32 GDI blit with no orientation handling). "Preview" mode works correctly because it generates PDFs and prints through the OS print pipeline.

**Fix:** Make "direct" mode use the same PDF generation as "preview" mode, then print silently via [silent_print_pdf()](file:///c:/Users/Kevin%20Biju%20Kulangara/OneDrive/Desktop/laundry/utils/receipt.py#695-744) instead of the GDI image path.

## Proposed Changes

### Receipt Module

#### [MODIFY] [receipt.py](file:///c:/Users/Kevin%20Biju%20Kulangara/OneDrive/Desktop/laundry/utils/receipt.py)

**[open_receipt_pdf()](file:///c:/Users/Kevin%20Biju%20Kulangara/OneDrive/Desktop/laundry/utils/receipt.py#949-974)** (line 949–973): Rewrite so both branches call [generate_dispatch_challan_pdf()](file:///c:/Users/Kevin%20Biju%20Kulangara/OneDrive/Desktop/laundry/utils/receipt.py#299-560). In "preview" mode, open the PDF for viewing (unchanged). In "direct" mode, call [silent_print_pdf(path)](file:///c:/Users/Kevin%20Biju%20Kulangara/OneDrive/Desktop/laundry/utils/receipt.py#695-744) instead of delegating to [open_receipt()](file:///c:/Users/Kevin%20Biju%20Kulangara/OneDrive/Desktop/laundry/utils/receipt.py#932-947).

```diff
 def open_receipt_pdf(order_data: dict, parent_window=None) -> str:
     ...
     if print_mode == "preview":
         path = generate_dispatch_challan_pdf(order_data)
         ...  # open for viewing — unchanged
         return path
     else:
-        return open_receipt(order_data)
+        path = generate_dispatch_challan_pdf(order_data)
+        silent_print_pdf(path)
+        return path
```

**[open_receipt()](file:///c:/Users/Kevin%20Biju%20Kulangara/OneDrive/Desktop/laundry/utils/receipt.py#932-947)** (line 932–946): Also switch to PDF + [silent_print_pdf()](file:///c:/Users/Kevin%20Biju%20Kulangara/OneDrive/Desktop/laundry/utils/receipt.py#695-744) because it's called from [print_settings.py](file:///c:/Users/Kevin%20Biju%20Kulangara/OneDrive/Desktop/laundry/ui/print_settings.py) test-print button. This ensures test prints also go through the correct pipeline.

```diff
 def open_receipt(order_data: dict):
-    path = generate_dispatch_challan_image(order_data)
+    path = generate_dispatch_challan_pdf(order_data)
     if print_mode == "preview":
         ...  # open for viewing
     else:
-        silent_print_image(path)
+        silent_print_pdf(path)
     return path
```

